    "body": "@fantasai pointed out to me that in https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10296#issuecomment-2778703697 there was discussion about a different specificity for these pseudo-classes, but this does not appear to be reflected in the changes to the Selectors specification, despite claims back in April that it would be. Can someone clarify this for me?",
