    "created_at": "2025-08-06T07:06:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-08-06T07:06:02Z",
    "body": "Indeed, long ago we have settled on ARIA not influencing semantics. It's an expert tool that solely influences AT. (This does mean that `:heading(1)` could match the same thing as `[aria-level=2]`, but this would also be highly indicative of an authoring error.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
